0%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E4%BD%A9%E6%8B%89\" title=\"洛佩拉\"><img alt=\"洛佩拉\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E4%BD%A9%E6%8B%89\" title=\"洛佩拉\">洛佩拉</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.6</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>非理性迷宫</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：310203</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"5\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">追击</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"5\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3102/310203/技能一.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3102/310203/技能一 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3102/310203/技能二.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3102/310203/技能二 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3102/310203/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3102/310203/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3102/310203/追击1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3102/310203/追击1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3102/310203/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3102/310203/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">诚征队友！为防止本人或你在黑水森林中遭遇不测<br />嘿！各位酒馆里的冒险者们，本人准备去黑水森林探险，需要队友三位，有以下要求：<br />1.身手过硬，能够连续击败多名地精首领<br />2.没有连续掷出过三次大失败<br />3.不介意随行的动物伙伴偷吃你的口粮<br />4.有地下城探险经验，欢迎宝箱怪爱好者<br /><br />关于本人：<br />1.接受过军事训练、实力强劲的猎人，手脚十分灵活，可以破坏大部分的机关<br />2.懂炼金术，能够调配出几种常见药剂，但不保证百分百有效，欢迎免疫毒药体质的队友<br /><br />附加：谢绝之前的队友，和你们组队后我的大失败记录已经榜上有名。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"310203\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7e/Belonging-310204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">精灵饰品套组<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Elven Ear Cuffs</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />35<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>由“秘银”打造，其精致的镂空与美丽的曲线正是精灵族最喜爱的饰品造型。即使在险地跋涉，经历苦战，游侠也从未怠慢这套来自家乡之物。<br />真实材料为铝丝、锡纸与玻璃珠。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/db/Belonging-310205.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“荒野之道”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Way of the Wilderness\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />38<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>在冒险小队首次完成领主级战斗，到达战后第一个交易点时，游侠从最优秀的道具商人那里买下了这把手弩。这让她花光了她在地精据点缴获的全部金币，但之后的冒险证明，这笔花销绝对物有所值。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310206.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8a/Belonging-310206.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">青苔绿\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">印花绒面斗篷</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Green Cape with Patterned Trim</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />4<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>工艺精美的深绿色旅行斗篷，结实耐脏，能很好地为冒险者抵御野外夜晚的寒冷。不过当主持人宣布长休时，游侠往往会选择将它披在风暴猫身上，自己则依偎着这位伙伴温暖柔软的皮毛入睡。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 与风暴同行1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 与风暴同行2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">与风暴同行 <small style=\"color: grey\">Friend of the Splintercat</small></span></span>"}}